<title>UK: DePfa sets 1.0 bln mark five-year bond, +5-7 bp.</title>
<headline>DePfa sets 1.0 bln mark five-year bond, +5-7 bp.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Commerzbank, Merrill Lynch and Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE PFANDBRIEF- UND HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    13.NOV.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    13.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+5-7 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT/SING  PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.75	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.25 PCT BUND DUE SEP.01 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
